	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et pacem a domino etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Non dubito, vir ornatissime, quin rumor collationis <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>nostrae cum anabaptistis<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Das Gespräch mit den Täufern fand vom 11. bis 15. Januar statt, vgl. <bibl source="b520">QGTS</bibl> II 136, Anm. 2.</note> ad vos pervenerit nosque temerarii incepti, praesertim vobis <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>inconsultis, facile potuisse insimulari.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Sed quum aliter occurri non potuit (gras<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>sabantur enim luporum in morem per ovilia Christi, simplices oves abducebant tam impune, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ut nusquam liberius ipsis et versari et vagari permitteretur), convenimus primum mag<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>istratum petentes et obsecrantes, ut pro officio caverent, ne quid per eos respublica <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Christi damni pateretur.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Ibi cautum, ut in vincula coniecti aut emendarentur <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>aut amandarentur.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Oblati sunt unus et alter tam stupidi, ut truncos potius <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>dixisses quam homines.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Per praesides erga coryϕaeos [!] negligentius agebatur, neque ulli <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>offerebantur; subduxerant enim se relictis in nido pullis implumibus<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Vgl. <persName ref="p19882">Horaz</persName>, Epoden, 1, 19.</note>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p6371">Georgius <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Sattler</persName><note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p6371">Georg (Jörg) Sattler</persName> war ein Täuferführer ("doctor anabaptistarum", s. unten <ref target="file11776">Nr. 1731</ref>, 16) aus <placeName ref="l1973">Oberhallau</placeName> im <placeName ref="l923">Klettgau</placeName>, der im Sommer 1543 in <placeName ref="l21">Baden</placeName> gefangengesetzt wurde, vgl. <bibl source="b520">QGTS</bibl> II 136, Anm. 3. Weiteres ist über ihn nicht bekannt.</note> cum <persName ref="p4412">Marco Brunner</persName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Über den Täufer <persName ref="p4412">Markus Brunner</persName> ist sonst nichts bekannt.</note> expostulabat nos iniquis conditionibus <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>cum ipsis agere;<pb type="edition" next="71"/> ipsos in cathenis e carcere causam dicere, nos in plumis <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>eos e culma reos agere; sed si salvus daretur conductus, quod facile nos et in <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>doctrina et oeconomia ecclesiastica erroris convincere posset.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Igitur <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>unanimi decreto synodi nostrae visum est ipsis a senatu efflagita<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>re liberum accessum.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Decernitur, ordinantur quatuor praesides collationis, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>et si quibusdam e senatu visum esset interesse, ut admitterentur.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Ibi cum iam <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>adgressuri essemus negotium, postulant anabaptistae, ut publice coram <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>plebe ageretur.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Intercessorem habent partium suarum <persName ref="p2299">Valdk[irchium]</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Bürgermeister <persName ref="p2299">Hans von Waldkirch</persName>.</note>, quem hucus<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>que <persName ref="p21166">Erynnides</persName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p21166">Erinnyen</persName>: Furien, Rachegöttinnen, s. Sarah Iles <hi>Johnston,</hi> in: <bibl source="b185">DNP</bibl> IV 72.</note> anabaptisticae flagris suis tam misere adfligunt, ut adhuc <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>sui compos non sit, <foreign xml:lang="el">τὸ δὲ ὕπουλον</foreign> diu, nosti, in pectore fovit.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Admittitur plebs, congressio fit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Iniquiores habemus praesides, id quod non <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>dubito, quin <persName ref="p2810">Erasmus</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p2810">Erasmus Ritter</persName>.</note> (illi enim commisimus hoc negotii) vobis retulerit.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Veritas a nobis stabat, sesquipedalia verba<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Vgl. <persName ref="p19882">Horaz</persName>, Ars poetica 97.</note>, favor papistarum et ana<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>baptistarum ab ipsis.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Cordatis et paulo emunctioris nasi hominibus<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Vgl. Adagia, 2, 8, 59 (<bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> II 652f).</note> suboluit <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>anabaptistas hypocrisi et contentione armatos agere, nos dextre contra tr<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>actare scripturas.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Tandem finita disputatione cum senatus decretum <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>expectaremus, nihil adhuc actum.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8421">Bovillus</persName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><persName ref="p8421">Ludwig Oechsli</persName>.</note> noluit hucusque rem <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>ad senatum referre; nos admonuimus hominem officii (erat enim praeses <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>collationis).</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Qui si nolit, nos senatum<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Vor</hi> senatum <hi>gestrichenes</hi> rem ad.</note> conveniemus<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Vor</hi> conveniemus <hi>gestrichenes</hi> referemus.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ac, nisi anabaptistas et urbe et agro pellant, missionem ab ipsis (nisi <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>forte aliter vobis, fratribus nostris charissimis, visum fuerit) postulabimus.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Omnem enim prius movimus lapidem,<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Vgl. Adagia, 1,4, 30 (<bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> II 161f).</note> ne cogeremur et sectionis et usturae <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>implorare subsidia.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Non tamen temere novabimus aliquid vobis inconsultis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z35"/>Caetera, quae aut <persName ref="p2810">Erasmus</persName> non retulit aut ego non scripsi, poterit hic <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>conterraneus tuus, <persName ref="p6382">Hanns Adam Schad</persName><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="12"><persName ref="p6382">Hans Adam Schad</persName>, der Briefüberbringer, stammte aus <placeName ref="l62">Bremgarten</placeName>, war aber bereits 1534 in <placeName ref="l441">Schaffhausen</placeName> ansässig (vgl. <bibl source="b520">QGTS</bibl> II 137, Anm. 8). 1557 schrieb <persName ref="p3481">Simprecht Vogt</persName> wegen einer Bürgschaft für <persName ref="p6382">Schad</persName> an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> (s. Zürich StA, E II 375, 512; vgl. <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Antwort vom 14. Oktober 1557, E II 356, 879).</note>, ad longum referre; inter<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>fuit enim collationi.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Pius est et cordatus.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Cum hoc poteris item con<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>ferre, si quid habes, quod ad hanc rem faciat.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Sed de his satis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Caeterum, <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>quandoquidem tuam inenarrabilem humanitatem non semel expertus sum <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>eaque me aliquantum audaculum fecit, oro et obtestor te, ut eorum, quę <persName ref="p1753">Leo</persName><note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><persName ref="p1753">Leo Jud</persName>.</note>, piae <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>memoriae vir, ab ore <persName ref="p8171">Bibliandri</persName> in Hieremiam excepit,<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Gemeint sind <persName ref="p8171">Biblianders</persName> Jeremiavorlesungen vom Frühling 1540 bis zum 16. Februar 1541, vgl. <hi>Egli,</hi> Analecta II 135. <persName ref="p1753">Leo Juds</persName> Mitschriften sind nicht erhalten.</note> mihi copiam facias <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>tuaque, quae in eundem proϕetam [!] dictasti,<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15"><persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> hat bis zum Februar 1543 keine Vorlesungen oder Predigten über Jeremia gehalten. <persName ref="p3481">Vogt</persName> bezieht sich wohl auf <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Mitschrift von <persName ref="p8171">Biblianders</persName> Jeremiavorlesungen (Zürich ZB, Ms Car. I 85).</note><pb type="edition" next="72"/> mutuo des; nihil adultera<lb xml:id="p1z43"/>bitur, nihil immutabitur, nihil interpolabitur, omnia syncere ac optima fide re<lb xml:id="p1z44"/>stituentur.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Hoc enim pacto non solum <placeName ref="l587">Tygurinae</placeName>, sed et <placeName ref="l441">Scaffusianę</placeName> ecclesię <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>commodabis.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Novi, quod tua plurima <persName ref="p1391">Berchtoldo</persName><note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16"><persName ref="p1391">Berchtold Haller</persName>.</note> <placeName ref="l41">Bernensi</placeName> mutua<lb xml:id="p1z46"/>veris;<note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17">Vgl. <bibl source="b5">HBBW III</bibl> <ref target="file10312">[Nr. 281]</ref>. S. 222, 6; 276, 67f; IV, S. 56, 57f; 72, 51f; 86, 101; 128, 1-3; V, S. 421f, 5-23; 447. 1-11.</note> eodem, quo ipse, nempe<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>Vor</hi> nempe <hi>gestrichenes</hi> sive.</note> charitatis iure a te exigo, si non <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>par relaturus, certe non ingratus futurus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Monstrum hisce diebus apud nos <lb xml:id="p1z48"/>natum est<note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="18">Über die Geburt siamesischer Zwillinge am 6. Februar 1543 in <placeName ref="l441">Schaffhausen</placeName> berichtet auch ein bei <persName ref="p4853">Eustachius Froschauer</persName> erschienener illustrierter Einblattdruck von <persName ref="p6285">Jakob Ruf</persName>, s. Manfred <hi>Vischer,</hi> Zürcher Einblattdrucke des 16. Jahrhunderts, Baden-Baden 2001. - Bibliotheca bibliographica Aureliana 185, Nr. A 41 (Edition geplant in: Jakob Ruf. Leben, Werk und Studien, hg. v. Hildegard Elisabeth Keller, Bd. 2, Zürich 2008).</note>.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Quale sit, referet tabellio, si desideraveris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale et vive <lb xml:id="p1z49"/>Christo et ecclesiae suae diu incolumis.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta nomine meo <persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName><note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z50"/><persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName>, <persName ref="p8412">Megandrum</persName>, <persName ref="p8437">Fabricium</persName><note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20"><persName ref="p8437">Erasmus Schmid</persName>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te <persName ref="p8090">Lingkius</persName><note xml:id="fn21" type="footnote" n="21"><persName ref="p8090">Heinrich Linggi</persName>.</note> et <persName ref="p1309">Grü<lb xml:id="p1z51"/>bellius</persName><note xml:id="fn22" type="footnote" n="22"><persName ref="p1309">Sebastian Grübel</persName>.</note>, symmystae mei.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">Raptim, <placeName ref="l441">Scaffusiae</placeName>, 8. idus februarii <lb xml:id="p1z52"/>anno a Christo nato 1543.</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z53"/>Tuus ex animo <lb xml:id="p1z54"/><persName ref="p3481">Simpertus Vogtius</persName>, <placeName ref="l441">Scaffusia<lb xml:id="p1z55"/>nae</placeName> ecclesiae minister.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Incomparabili eruditione <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>et <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>pietate ornato viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>Bullingero</persName>, fratri <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>suo colendissimo, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>pastori <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>vigilantissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
